  <ScenTitle>Sandbox Nations #1, 2018</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;SandBox Nations #1&lt;/U&gt; : Italy2018 - Spain - Germany&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;EM&gt;This SandBox scenario aims to show the database expansions created for Italy, Spain and Germany.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Very Simple Scenario,can choose all three factions to see the structures I added for each one.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;I hope this scenario is useful to those who can not use the editor but who want to see the expansions of these three nations.T&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;o make it a little more pleasant I put a small mission to do vs France.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
